! IOS XE VPN router system logging template.
! Replace placeholders and validate platform/release support before use.
! Use an approved management path to the syslog collector; the VPN WAN ACL
! permits only peer-specific IKE and ESP. Protect log transport and storage
! according to site policy; this example does not configure syslog TLS.
! Synchronize the system clock using the approved time service.
!
service timestamps log datetime msec
!
! Persistent logging writes buffered messages to local storage.
! Confirm available space, storage limits, rotation, and retention.
logging buffered informational
logging persistent threshold 75
logging console notifications
logging on
!
! The remote threshold permits severity 0-7 messages but does not enable
! debugging. The local informational buffer excludes severity 7 messages.
logging trap debugging
logging source-interface <MGMT-INT> vrf <MGMT-VRF>
logging host <SYSLOG-IP> vrf <MGMT-VRF>
!
! Verify show logging and representative VPN events on the target device.
! These settings do not guarantee generation or delivery of every event.
